Base URL/invoke url: https://n2ifyru5ti.execute-api.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/dev

1. Register (POST)
URL: https://n2ifyru5ti.execute-api.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/dev/auth/register
JSON Body:
{
  "username": "string",
  "email": "string",
  "password": "string",
  "createdDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
  "firstName": "string",
  "lastName": "string"
}

2. Login (GET)
URL: https://n2ifyru5ti.execute-api.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/dev/auth/login?username=VALUE&password=VALUE

3. Get Profile (GET)
URL: https://n2ifyru5ti.execute-api.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/dev/profile?uuid=USER_UUID

4. Generate Avatar Upload URL (POST)
URL: https://n2ifyru5ti.execute-api.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/dev/profile/avatar
JSON Body:
{
  "uuid": "USER_UUID",
  "contentType": "image/jpeg"
}
(Note: PUT the image file to the returned "uploadUrl", then save the returned "profilePicUrl" using endpoint #5.)

5. Update Profile (POST)
URL: https://n2ifyru5ti.execute-api.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/dev/profile/update
JSON Body (include only fields being updated):
{
  "uuid": "USER_UUID",
  "username": "string",
  "firstName": "string",
  "lastName": "string",
  "bio": "string",
  "profilePicUrl": "string"
}
